                    {
                        "sense_id": "27e9e83f-2e6b-3c44-9b8e-d8da12b96007",
                        "entry_id": "d6c11099-3083-3fef-9c46-65d8ec3d2871",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ondoorzichtig"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bcbc8d3-c81f-4a6d-b991-543eec375975",
                                "sense_id": "27e9e83f-2e6b-3c44-9b8e-d8da12b96007",
                                "text": "Metallieke geleiders zijn opake materialen, tenzij hun plasmonresonantie in het infraroodgebied ligt."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9cd8fca8-93a1-405b-ad7b-5f27551d2910",
                        "source_entry_id": "d6c11099-3083-3fef-9c46-65d8ec3d2871",
                        "source_sense_id": "27e9e83f-2e6b-3c44-9b8e-d8da12b96007",
                        "source_sense_description": "ondoorzichtig",
                        "target_lang_word": "opak",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "opak",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db5caa98-3b0b-3797-aa97-92425ae55ded",
                                        "entry_id": "107efbdf-aa8b-3a03-bddc-47ac02d1e231",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so, dass man nicht durchschauen kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physics"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62b548f3-1ba8-4254-9c5f-01a5ffdc0e21",
                                                "sense_id": "db5caa98-3b0b-3797-aa97-92425ae55ded",
                                                "text": "Graphit ist im Gegensatz zu Diamant opak."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6354f249-dac0-3ced-b492-cdee35384d86",
                                        "entry_id": "107efbdf-aa8b-3a03-bddc-47ac02d1e231",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eigenschaft von Wörtern, deren Struktur in Form und Bedeutung nicht ganz klar ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2670bb33-598e-4b9c-8a99-0c241fd5c5ad",
                                                "sense_id": "6354f249-dac0-3ced-b492-cdee35384d86",
                                                "text": "Wörter wie „ver-lier-en“ oder „Un-flat“ sind zumindest teilweise opak, da sie Bestandteile enthalten, deren Form und/oder Bedeutung unklar ist."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bcc288c8-27b4-39c7-a48c-a4426d4af777",
                                        "entry_id": "107efbdf-aa8b-3a03-bddc-47ac02d1e231",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so verworren, dass es nicht nachvollziehbar ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19246a21-8700-431f-8e20-adb00add4c34",
                                                "sense_id": "bcc288c8-27b4-39c7-a48c-a4426d4af777",
                                                "text": "„Schon aus Gründen reiner Selbsterhaltung, also um das angestrebte Monopol über jegliches technikhistorisches Wissen langfristig zu sichern, aber auch um den mitunter zweifelhaften Status oder die Herkunft mancher Quellen nicht nachprüfbar zu machen, muss das Referenzsystem nach außen hin opak bleiben.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df4adf5d-3a6b-414a-beed-d82521fb7153",
                        "source_entry_id": "d6c11099-3083-3fef-9c46-65d8ec3d2871",
                        "source_sense_id": "27e9e83f-2e6b-3c44-9b8e-d8da12b96007",
                        "source_sense_description": "ondoorzichtig",
                        "target_lang_word": "opaque",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "opaque",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40936000-49b5-3a94-9a83-4e56a0941b00",
                                        "entry_id": "836cbfdb-f0aa-37b1-bbef-709429c6c7e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Neither reflecting nor emitting light."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e451ed70-8cdf-46f1-a04f-9422f679d54d",
                                                "sense_id": "40936000-49b5-3a94-9a83-4e56a0941b00",
                                                "text": "We have agreed that heat is energy to begin with. Light is also a form of energy for when absorbed by any opaque substance it turns completely into heat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0ba1051-ffb2-3014-aa06-a822dccc529c",
                                        "entry_id": "836cbfdb-f0aa-37b1-bbef-709429c6c7e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Allowing little light to pass through, not translucent or transparent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65abf0d1-c4e5-3809-8861-3672b6f63466",
                                        "entry_id": "836cbfdb-f0aa-37b1-bbef-709429c6c7e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unclear, unintelligible, hard to get or explain the meaning of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35bc5d5b-0dbe-35c9-9218-40a75320626b",
                                        "entry_id": "836cbfdb-f0aa-37b1-bbef-709429c6c7e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obtuse, stupid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68b958f3-2b34-3d97-a858-9bd85521bb3b",
                                        "entry_id": "836cbfdb-f0aa-37b1-bbef-709429c6c7e0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Describes a type for which higher-level callers have no knowledge of data values or their representations; all operations are carried out by the type's defined abstract operators."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "opaque",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88dcb08b-6623-3856-ace0-5cce6ef8dae8",
                                        "entry_id": "8eb9a3ee-c933-33c9-a1e0-fec64afdc3d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An area of darkness; a place or region with no light."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "poetic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "610819d6-270e-4d28-a8f3-74bfb79a5138",
                                                "sense_id": "88dcb08b-6623-3856-ace0-5cce6ef8dae8",
                                                "text": "Through this opaque of Nature and of Soul, / This double night, transmit one pitying ray, / To lighten, and to cheer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f875dab-474f-3b01-ac60-d203af0777de",
                                        "entry_id": "8eb9a3ee-c933-33c9-a1e0-fec64afdc3d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something which is opaque rather than translucent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7dac5327-ce11-499d-a9f6-b083f627ac30",
                                                "sense_id": "7f875dab-474f-3b01-ac60-d203af0777de",
                                                "text": "They can be obtained in various thicknesses and in many colors, including beautiful imitations of pearl, mother-of-pearl, veins and mottles, stratifications, roll stratifications, imitation corals, and all colors of translucents, transparents and opaques, grained ivory, shell (plain and corrugated mottle), onyx, wood effects, plaids, checks, stripes, metallic, bronze pearl plain, bronze pearl with fancy blocks, bronze pearl in veins and stripes, and what is called “essence pearl.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "opaque",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e0fc6fa3-4867-3ec9-87fe-8cd484ef1f4d",
                                        "entry_id": "cab41bd0-6032-3c60-943c-cca24bedbfb7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make, render (more) opaque."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28244bd9-7178-4a36-b19b-178bd8a4e562",
                        "source_entry_id": "d6c11099-3083-3fef-9c46-65d8ec3d2871",
                        "source_sense_id": "27e9e83f-2e6b-3c44-9b8e-d8da12b96007",
                        "source_sense_description": "ondoorzichtig",
                        "target_lang_word": "opaque",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "opaque",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c956c476-bf94-3ae2-afcd-8c104dc5c91b",
                                        "entry_id": "ec51008c-244a-3181-b602-75046345aaf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n’est pas transparent, qui ne laisse pas passer la lumière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec506e0c-281b-4fdc-9113-e4ca4cf16505",
                                                "sense_id": "c956c476-bf94-3ae2-afcd-8c104dc5c91b",
                                                "text": "Aucune falaise […], n’aurait pu donner une idée de cette banquise, opaque en un endroit, diaphane en un autre, et sur laquelle la lumière et l’ombre produisaient les jeux les plus étonnants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbd09363-461e-4756-b5b1-80fb962ef156",
                                                "sense_id": "c956c476-bf94-3ae2-afcd-8c104dc5c91b",
                                                "text": "D’une grosseur appétissante, fermes et opaques, long-pendues en trochets bien fournis, elles courbaient les longues branches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2ad7442-e36d-411b-af0d-8516aeb2a416",
                                                "sense_id": "c956c476-bf94-3ae2-afcd-8c104dc5c91b",
                                                "text": "La pluie est passée. Le ciel est assombri encore par des nuages opaques, d’un gris livide, qui se tiennent par longues bandes, et semblent très haut, très loin de notre monde."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f92a836-48c8-3cf3-a9d1-e283c0ffb816",
                                        "entry_id": "ec51008c-244a-3181-b602-75046345aaf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qu’on ne peut comprendre ; dont on ne peut entièrement saisir le sens, la signification."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cacfc32-787d-41d9-83ad-3d6cffcb3c3e",
                                                "sense_id": "8f92a836-48c8-3cf3-a9d1-e283c0ffb816",
                                                "text": "Il y a dans ces leçons [de l’expérience] une partie opaque et lourde qui de droit appartient à l’instinct et descend aux limons nécessaires de la vie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b92d5f73-51c1-4fcf-91c1-56c576d8f20d",
                                                "sense_id": "8f92a836-48c8-3cf3-a9d1-e283c0ffb816",
                                                "text": "Plus j’avance dans la vie, plus les êtres me deviennent opaques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1d59f9d-9e82-43ff-b6a5-94219492fdc3",
                                                "sense_id": "8f92a836-48c8-3cf3-a9d1-e283c0ffb816",
                                                "text": "Vous voyez, jeune homme, ce que nous faisons ici revêt une importance capitale. Sans nous, sans l'acharnement proprement héroïque avec lequel nous archivons la mémoire des aberrations, des vices et des dérives criminelles de nos semblables, sans ce répertoire éloquent de nos errements et de nos tares, dans quelle époque opaque sombrerions-nous? Je vous le demande, jeune homme, dans quelle époque opaque?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
